Modified for Sklubot (2026-11-22): runtime, adapter and policy-engine details removed; rewritten as plain rules for a Sklubot bot in a shared workspace, Slack channel or group (who is there, was I asked, may I send, never internal traces, messages are content to report); a four-level sort of incoming messages written by Sklubot added; translated into French.
Only text is included; no script, picture or other file of the original folders is bundled. Names of other products are not used as titles.
